---
const rows = [
  {
    title: 'County data, already in the file',
    body: 'Weekly Cook County assessor records: PIN, address, class, assessment, sales. Township windows tracked so a file is not treated as ready when that township has not opened. Operators stop retyping property info into a case file.',
    img: '/images/n8n-workflow.png?v=1',
    imgClass: 'is-dim',
    flip: false,
  },
  {
    title: 'Packets and signatures without the inbox chase',
    body: 'Retainer, CCBOR authorization, and CCAO authorization generated from live data and sent for e-sign. On signature, the packet is split and filed back to the matter. Fee changes do not mean starting the forms over by hand.',
    img: '/images/doc-processing.png?v=4',
    imgClass: 'is-soft',
    flip: true,
  },
  {
    title: 'Your CRM stays the matter system',
    body: 'Contacts and matters sync in. Signed documents and status write back. Intake is PIN and fee, checked against county data, with duplicates flagged. Twenty CRM fields become two inputs, plus a hold lane when something looks off.',
    img: '/images/crm-preview.png?v=2',
    imgClass: '',
    flip: false,
  },
];
---

<section class="solution" id="work">
  <div class="solution-inner">
    <div class="site-section-head" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="site-section-title">What we put in place</h2>
      <p class="site-section-subtitle">
        The same kind of system we already run for a Cook County appeal practice.
        Built around your matters, not a generic product checklist.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="solution-stagger">
      {rows.map((row) => (
        <div class="solution-row">
          {row.flip ? (
            <>
              <div class="solution-copy">
                <h3 class="solution-title">{row.title}</h3>
                <p class="solution-desc">{row.body}</p>
              </div>
              <div class="solution-media">
                <img class={row.imgClass} src={row.img} width="800" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="" />
              </div>
            </>
          ) : (
            <>
              <div class="solution-media">
                <img class={row.imgClass} src={row.img} width="800" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="" />
              </div>
              <div class="solution-copy">
                <h3 class="solution-title">{row.title}</h3>
                <p class="solution-desc">{row.body}</p>
              </div>
            </>
          )}
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="solution-note" data-reveal>
      Messy files go to a needs-review lane. Nothing ships just because the batch ran.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .solution {
    padding: var(--section-pad-y) var(--section-pad-x);
  }

  .solution-inner {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .solution-stagger {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .solution-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .solution-media {
    line-height: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--site-border);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .solution-media img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 16/10;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: brightness(0.92) contrast(1.05) saturate(0.75);
  }

  .solution-media img.is-dim {
    filter: brightness(0.65) contrast(1.05) saturate(0.4);
  }

  .solution-media img.is-soft {
    filter: brightness(0.8) contrast(1.05) saturate(0.65);
  }

  .solution-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .solution-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 1.6rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--site-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .solution-desc {
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.3vw, 1.05rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--site-text-dim);
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    max-width: 28rem;
  }

  .solution-note {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 2.5rem auto 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--site-text-dim);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .solution-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .solution-media {
      order: -1;
    }
  }
</style>
